🇺🇸⚡️ — U.S. Secretary of State Rubio may resign as part of preparations for running in the 2028 presidential election, according to a report by the British newspaper The Independent, citing sources.

According to the publication, Rubio needs to distance himself from the policies of the Trump administration, including the conflict in Iran. The newspaper suggested that this would increase his chances in a potential contest with Vance.

